  "speakers": [
   "投資人關係副處長 Jessie Wang",
   "財務長 David Ku",
   "執行長 Rick Tsai"
  ],
  "quotes": [
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "Revenue for the quarter was NT$168.1 billion dollars, up 10.4% sequentially, and up 18.3% year-over- year.",
    "anchor": "第 1 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 1
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "Gross margin for the quarter was 46.3%, up 0.1 percentage points from the previous quarter, and down 0.2 percentage points from the year-ago quarter.",
    "anchor": "第 1 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 1
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "Operating margin for the quarter was 16.1%, up 1.1 percentage points in the previous quarter and up 0.5 percentage points year-over-year.",
    "anchor": "第 1 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 1
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "Non-TIFRS operating margin for the quarter was 16.6%.",
    "anchor": "第 1 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 1
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "For 2027, we expect this program to achieve the high end of our revenue target range of approximately US$16 billion, representing around 20% of the total AI accelerator ASIC market.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "This confidence is underpinned by our solid supply outlook.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "For our second AI accelerator project, the development is progressing well, and we are on track for high- volume production in the first quarter of 2028.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "We expect this project to further strengthen our market position and contribute substantially to our revenue growth.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Moving to guidance, driven by the ramp of our AI accelerator business, we expect strong sequential revenue growth in the fourth quarter despite a high base in the third quarter.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "We expect our fourth quarter revenue to be in the range of NT$210.1 billion dollars to NT$221.8 billion dollars, grow 25% to 32% sequentially, and up 40% to 48% year-over-year at a forecasted exchange rate of 31.7 NT dollars to 1 US dollar.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "毛利率",
    "text": "Gross margin is forecasted at 45%, plus or minus 1.5 percentage points, and operating expense ratio is forecasted at 26%, plus or minus 2 percentage points.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Based on our fourth quarter guidance, we now expect our full year revenue growth to exceed our previous target of high-single-digit percentage growth in US dollars.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "We believe our expanding presence across edge and cloud will pave the way for MediaTek’s sustainable growth in the era of ubiquitous AI.",
    "anchor": "第 2 頁",
    "who": "Rick Tsai",
    "title": "執行長 Rick Tsai",
    "seg": 3
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "The new project right now is kicking off and working on right now, and we're talking about you will see the first revenue coming in 2028.",
    "anchor": "第 8 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 12
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "Again normally we will disclose more detail later on, but this is just confirmed, we do have a second customer and MP, the revenue coming in 2028.",
    "anchor": "第 8 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 12
   },
   {
    "cat": "營益率與費用",
    "text": "And if we talk about next year guidance for the operating margin, I think overall we are looking for 20% plus, if not slightly higher.",
    "anchor": "第 12 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 33
   },
   {
    "cat": "營益率與費用",
    "text": "But overall, we feel comfortable for the full year basis, next year operating margin should be above 20%.",
    "anchor": "第 12 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 33
   },
   {
    "cat": "毛利率",
    "text": "And again, that's all in-line with what we talked about right now, probably almost like 1.5 years ago we say the business model, or the new business model if you like, we're adopting right now is actually the gross margins compared to what we have right now may be slightly dilutive, but operating margin will be accretive.",
    "anchor": "第 12 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 33
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "And once we can deliver that, we're going to -- based on pretty solid growth, to deliver, the new revenue for 2028 and beyond.",
    "anchor": "第 15 頁",
    "who": "David Ku",
    "title": "財務長 David Ku",
    "seg": 45
   }
  ],
